<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 antialiased">

    <!-- Header / Navigation -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur border-b border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-20 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="bg-brand-600 text-white p-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xl tracking-tight">Unlock</div>
                <div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 block">Product Guide</span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">August 2026 Version</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600">
                <a href="#about" class="hover:text-brand-600 transition">About HEA</a>
                <a href="#checklist" class="hover:text-brand-600 transition">Knowledge Checklist</a>
                <a href="#focus" class="hover:text-brand-600 transition">Key Focus Areas</a>
                <a href="#disclaimers" class="hover:text-brand-600 transition">Disclaimers</a>
            </nav>
            <div>
                <a href="#checklist" class="bg-brand-600 text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-medium text-sm hover:bg-brand-700 transition shadow-sm">Review Guide</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-900 via-brand-700 to-emerald-800 text-white py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
            <span class="inline-block bg-white/10 text-emerald-200 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 border border-white/20">
                Official Product Guide
            </span>
            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6">
                Unlock Your Home Equity <br class="hidden sm:inline">Without Monthly Payments.
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-emerald-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 font-light leading-relaxed">
                Discover the Unlock Home Equity Agreement (HEA) — a flexible financial solution designed to give you cash up front with zero monthly payments for up to 10 years.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
                <a href="#about" class="bg-white text-brand-900 font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:bg-emerald-50 transition">
                    Learn How It Works
                </a>
                <a href="#checklist" class="bg-brand-600/50 text-white border border-white/30 font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl backdrop-blur hover:bg-brand-600 transition">
                    View Knowledge Checklist
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Section -->
    <section id="about" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl mb-4">Introduction to the Unlock HEA</h2>
            <div class="w-20 h-1.5 bg-brand-600 mx-auto rounded-full mb-6"></div>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
                Unlock is an innovative consumer finance company helping homeowners access the value of their biggest asset to dramatically improve their lives.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
            <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center">
                        <span class="bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg inline-flex items-center justify-center mr-3 font-semibold text-sm">1</span>
                        What is a Home Equity Agreement?
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                        When your Unlock HEA closes, you receive a lump-sum cash payment. You can use the money for up to 10 years without interest charges or monthly payments. In exchange, Unlock receives a percentage of your home's value when you sell or buy us out.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center">
                        <span class="bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg inline-flex items-center justify-center mr-3 font-semibold text-sm">2</span>
                        What's The Catch?
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                        Put simply, there is no catch. Unlike traditional loans requiring monthly interest payments, HEAs allow homeowners to defer financing costs until settlement by sharing in a percentage of the home's future value.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-emerald-900 text-white p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-xl space-y-6">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Freedom & Flexibility</h3>
                <p class="text-emerald-100 leading-relaxed">
                    Imagine paying off high-interest debt, funding home renovations, securing long-term care insurance, or paying for college—all without monthly payments.
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-4 text-emerald-100 text-sm">
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        <span>No monthly payments for up to 10 years</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        <span>You control when your HEA ends (sell or buy out)</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                        <span>Comprehensive customer education & transparency</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Knowledge Checklist Section -->
    <section id="checklist" class="py-20 bg-slate-100 border-y border-slate-200 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <span class="text-brand-700 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Essential Summary</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl mt-2 mb-4">Knowledge Checklist</h2>
                <div class="w-20 h-1.5 bg-brand-600 mx-auto rounded-full mb-6"></div>
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
                    Review these key foundational concepts and terms before entering into an Unlock HEA.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Card 1 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-7 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-brand-600 font-bold text-lg mb-2">HEA Basics</div>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Established via Starting Home Value (appraisal). Unlock gives you a lump-sum cash payment. You maintain the funds for up to 10 years with no monthly payments. Unlock receives a percentage (determined by a multiplier, typically 1.8x) of the Ending Home Value at settlement.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Foundation</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 2 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-7 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-brand-600 font-bold text-lg mb-2">How Much Will You Pay?</div>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Cost depends on home value changes and term length. Expressed as Unlock Share (lump-sum payment at end) or Annualized Cost. Capped by the Annualized Cost Limit (typically 19.9% max).
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">The Numbers</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 3 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-7 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-brand-600 font-bold text-lg mb-2">Controlling Share Size</div>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Subject to minimum transaction sizes, you can choose a lower amount of cash up front to reduce Unlock's future share of your home's appreciation.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Flexibility</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 4 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-7 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-brand-600 font-bold text-lg mb-2">Property Types</div>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            Pricing varies for principal residences, second homes, and investment properties due to risk factors. Converting property use during the term triggers pricing adjustments.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Usage</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 5 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-7 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-brand-600 font-bold text-lg mb-2">Improvement Adjustments</div>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            If you make significant home improvements that increase your home's value, you can request an adjustment to lower the Ending Home Value so Unlock doesn't share in your added value.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Equity Protection</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 6 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-7 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-brand-600 font-bold text-lg mb-2">Fees & Expenses</div>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            At start: third-party transaction expenses + 4.9% Origination Fee (typical). At end: closing costs, appraisal, and realtor commissions.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Costs</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Key Focus Areas & Requirements -->
    <section id="focus" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 space-y-6">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Important Homeowner Requirements</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    During the term of your Unlock HEA, you agree to fulfill key responsibilities to maintain your agreement in good standing:
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-4 text-slate-700 text-sm">
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                        <span class="bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 p-1 rounded mr-3 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                        <span>Stay current on monthly mortgage loan payments, property taxes, and property insurance.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                        <span class="bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 p-1 rounded mr-3 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                        <span>Maintain your home in proper working order and good condition (normal wear & tear excepted).</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                        <span class="bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 p-1 rounded mr-3 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                        <span>Inform Unlock of major property or financial changes.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                        <span class="bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 p-1 rounded mr-3 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                        <span>Settle or end the HEA on or before its 10-year maximum term anniversary.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 space-y-6">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Liens & Defaults</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Unlock holds a lien on your property during the term. While foreclosure is always a last resort and homeowners are given time to cure issues, defaults include:
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-4 text-slate-700 text-sm">
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                        <span class="bg-red-100 text-red-700 p-1 rounded mr-3 mt-0.5">!</span>
                        <span>Falling behind on housing obligations (mortgage, taxes, insurance).</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                        <span class="bg-red-100 text-red-700 p-1 rounded mr-3 mt-0.5">!</span>
                        <span>Taking on unapproved debt in violation of the HEA terms.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start">
                        <span class="bg-red-100 text-red-700 p-1 rounded mr-3 mt-0.5">!</span>
                        <span>Failing to end the HEA at the end of the 10-year term.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

